From 23f841ed91eca354ede48850a3713d1d393e82f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 13:32:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tu: Do not bake static viewport/scissor when FDM is enabled

When a fragment shader uses FDM, viewport and scissor state must be
patched per-bin during GMEM rendering, even with a single viewport.

Cc: mesa-stable
Signed-off-by: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43953>

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/23f841ed91eca354ede48850a3713d1d393e82f6]

